# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstanceOfConcern> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Concentration> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Art 7(5)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines the the concentration, maximum concentration or concentration range of the substances of concern, at the level of the product, its relevant components, or spare parts; ESPR Art 7(5)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasConcentration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has concentration"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLifeCycleStage
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLifeCycleStage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLifeCycleStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstanceOfConcern> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLifeCycleStage> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Annex I (f)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLifeCycleStage> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLifeCycleStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Describes the life cycle stage during which the Substance of Concern occurs for product (used during production, resulting being in product, in waste); ESPR Annex I (f).\n\nKnown issue: Range is some type of an Event, not yet present in the EU DPP CO."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasLifeCycleStage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has life cycle stage"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasThreshold
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#SubstanceOfConcern> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Threshold> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasThreshold> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR FAQ 10.115, p59"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasThreshold> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://circabc.europa.eu/ui/group/418195ae-4919-45fa-a959-3b695c9aab28/library/25c48e7c-9ce3-41cb-96ac-d2942a8a29d6/details" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Describes relevant threshold of Substance of Concern.\n\nBy default, information on all substances of concern present in a product, above the  relevant thresholds, should be included in the DPP [ESPR FAQ 10.115, p59]"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#hasThreshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Has threshold"@en .
