# https://w3id.org/eudpp#Threshold
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Threshold> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Threshold> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR FAQ 10.115, p59"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Threshold> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "https://circabc.europa.eu/ui/group/418195ae-4919-45fa-a959-3b695c9aab28/library/25c48e7c-9ce3-41cb-96ac-d2942a8a29d6/details" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Threshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relevant threshold of Substance of Concern.\n\nBy default, information on all substances of concern present in a product, above the  relevant thresholds, should be included in the DPP [ESPR FAQ 10.115, p59]"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#Threshold> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Threshold of substance of concern"@en .
